      <p>This is the website of a sole-proprietor business. This policy explains what data is collected when you visit <a href="{{ site.url }}">{{ site.url }}</a> and how it is used.</p>

      <h2>1. Data this site collects</h2>
      <p><strong>Contact form.</strong> The name, email address, and message you submit through the contact form are used solely to reply to you and are never shared with any third party.</p>
      <p><strong>Visit statistics.</strong> This site uses GoatCounter, a self-hosted web analytics tool running on our own server. It is designed to work without cookies: no cross-site tracking, no profiling, and no personal identities stored. Only which pages were viewed and when, anonymously.</p>
      <p><strong>No marketing cookies.</strong> This site runs no ads and sets no advertising cookies, social media pixels, or any third-party trackers.</p>

      <h2>2. Third-party services involved</h2>
      <p>The site is hosted on Netlify. When you open a page, Netlify processes the request and, as is standard for every website, technically logs your IP address in its server logs. We do not control those logs and do not use them for profiling.</p>
      <p>Messages sent through the contact form are forwarded by Netlify to our email.</p>

      <h2>3. Your rights</h2>
      <p>You may request access, correction, deletion, or withdrawal of consent for your personal data at any time. Since the only personal data we hold is contact-form submissions, a deletion request can simply be sent to <a href="mailto:{{ site.email }}">{{ site.email }}</a> and will be processed promptly.</p>

      <h2>4. Contact</h2>
      <p>Questions about this policy? Reach us at <a href="mailto:{{ site.email }}">{{ site.email }}</a>{% if site.whatsapp %} or chat on <a href="https://wa.me/{{ site.whatsapp }}" target="_blank" rel="noopener">WhatsApp</a>{% endif %}.</p>

